      "value": "<p><em>“You were not beautiful. You were <strong>wanted</strong>.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Glamourfield (At Will, Minor).</strong> You can create subtle illusions affecting light, sound, scent, or emotional tone. It never overwhelms; it always influences.</p>\n        <p><strong>Dream Anchor.</strong> You have a +1 bonus to checks against metaphysical hazards (slippage, dream traps, Spark backlash).</p>",
